-Lock screen: 1) ridgekeyctl password set
-             2) System Settings -> Privacy & Security -> Accessibility -> enable "RidgeKey Agent"
-                (/usr/local/ridgekey/RidgeKeyAgent.app). Needed once; it survives upgrades.
